{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27236621","formula":"C₇₃H₁₁₂N₂₂O₁₆","hill":"C73H112N22O16","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":73.0,"H":112.0,"N":22.0,"O":16.0},"names":{"en":"Murepavadin"},"descriptions":{"en":"Murepavadin (POL7080) is a Pseudomonas specific peptidomimetic antibiotic. It is a synthetic cyclic beta hairpin peptidomimetic based on the cationic antimicrobial peptide protegrin I (PG-1) and the first example of an outer membrane protein-targeting antibiotic class with a novel, nonlytic mechanism of action, highly active and selective against the protein transporter LptD of Pseudomonas aeruginosa. In preclinical studies the compound was highly active on a broad panel of clinical isolates including multi-drug resistant Pseudomonas bacteria with outstanding in vivo efficacy in sepsis, lung, and thigh infection models."},"fame":2,"pubchemCid":91824766,"mass":1553.8,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC[C@H](C)[C@H]1C(=O)N[C@H](C(=O)N[C@H](C(=O)N[C@@H](C(=O)N[C@H](C(=O)N[C@H](C(=O)N[C@H](C(=O)N[C@H](C(=O)N[C@H](C(=O)N[C@H](C(=O)N2CCC[C@@H]2C(=O)N3CCC[C@H]3C(=O)N[C@H](C(=O)N[C@H](C(=O)N1)CC4=CNC5=CC=CC=C54)[C@@H](C)O)CO)C)CCN)CCN)CC6=CNC7=CC=CC=C76)CCN)CCN)CCCN)CCN","inchikey":"RIDRXGOBXZLKHZ-NZUANIILSA-N","iupac":"(3R,9S,12S,15S,18S,21S,24S,27R,30S,33S,36S,39S,42S,45S)-15,18,24,27,33-pentakis(2-aminoethyl)-30-(3-aminopropyl)-36-[(2S)-butan-2-yl]-42-[(1R)-1-hydroxyethyl]-9-(hydroxymethyl)-21,39-bis(1H-indol-3-ylmethyl)-12-methyl-1,7,10,13,16,19,22,25,28,31,34,37,40,43-tetradecazatricyclo[43.3.0.03,7]octatetracontane-2,8,11,14,17,20,23,26,29,32,35,38,41,44-tetradecone","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"91824766","atoms":223,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-8.273,"y":-1.175,"z":-1.758,"el":"C"},{"x":-8.454,"y":-2.676,"z":-1.605